note=Release tag 1.37.0 ("Free cached sky textures before model cleanup"). No git submodules.
#      Meson build system. 1.37.0 moved frame recording into r_passes.c (unified render
#      passes), so the visionOS stereo/VR overlay (0010/0018) now routes its offscreen
#      present image through R_RecordFrame (end_rendering_parms_t.ui_framebuffer_override).
#      Upstream f8cef54b (quicksave row in the Load menu) superseded the Load-menu half of
#      0013; only the iOS quick save/load chrome commands survive. See DECISIONS.md "upstream 1.37.0 pin bump".
